From 1bb7e6b43cf8ba31a6f438b35fc56b2f8c75ab6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 02:25:05 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] kcm_plasmalogin: one Form page, auto-login first, user and
 session as plain form rows
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Page type: Form (docs/page-design.md). KAuth save/sync/reset actions, config keys, defaults and the wallet check are
unchanged. Appearance.qml (sub-page with the wallpaper plugin config) is not touched: its FormLayout must stay
aligned with the wallpaper plugin's own config.qml (parentLayout alias).

Moved / renamed:
- Kirigami.Form/FormGroup/FormEntry -> Kirigami.FormLayout with separator sections (noun titles).
- Section 1 (no title): "Auto-login:" checkbox "Log in automatically" (was "Automatically log in: as user:"),
  then "User:" and "Session:" combo boxes as ordinary labelled rows (were two sentence fragments "as user:" /
  "with session:"), "Log in again immediately after logging off". The combos are disabled while auto-login is off
  instead of hidden (kcm_plasmalogin/settings-user, User, Session, Relogin).
- The KDE Wallet warning is its own form row with a capped width (24 gridUnit) so it cannot push the form into
  narrow mode (kcm_plasmalogin/OpenWallet).
- "Defaults" -> "Pre-selected at login": "User:" Last logged-in user / Specific user: [combo], "Session:" likewise
  (kcm_plasmalogin/settings-preselectedUser, settings-preselectedSession).
- Toolbar actions "Apply Plasma Settings…" and "Configure Appearance…" became buttons in a new "Appearance"
  section at the end, with a one-line hint for what Apply copies (kcm_plasmalogin/ApplyPlasmaSettings, ConfigureAppearance).
- Same structure and wording as kcm_sddm Behavior (auto-login rows), see the sddm-kcm commit.
- Relabel table: inventory/relabel/kcm_plasmalogin.tsv (outer repo).

Speed (read from code, not changed here): PlasmaLoginKcm::load() builds the wallpaper plugin (WallpaperIntegration::init,
KPackage lookup, KConfigLoader) before the first frame (src/frontend/kcm/kcm.cpp load, settings/wallpapersettings.cpp
loadWallpaperConfig), although only the Appearance sub-page shows it; moving it is not safe because isDefaults and
isSaveNeeded read it. PlasmaLoginData's constructor makes a blocking system-bus call to systemd (plasmalogindata.cpp:20-28),
which runs in the module-data hook, not at page open. The main page itself is now lighter (no per-row Loader-less
nesting, no Form/FormGroup). After: pending, manager will measure.

HIG: HIG-001, HIG-005, HIG-006, HIG-013, HIG-017, HIG-019, HIG-020, HIG-023, HIG-058.
Not built yet. Combo boxes in the auto-login rows show an empty box while auto-login is off and no user is set.

